    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ja">キーワード化・具体化と網羅・優先順位確認で提案前のズレを防ぐ上流プロセス。</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://books.local/Muhai_Eigyou____3_tsuno_Shitsumon____to___4_tsuno_Chikara_____-_Takahashi_Kouich/AnalysisFramework"/>
  </owl:Class>

  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://books.local/Muhai_Eigyou____3_tsuno_Shitsumon____to___4_tsuno_Chikara_____-_Takahashi_Kouich/OppositionLogic">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ja">対立ロジック</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ja">自社と競合・保留・内製の対立を明示し、当社を選ぶ理由で不協和を解消する下流プロセス。</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://books.local/Muhai_Eigyou____3_tsuno_Shitsumon____to___4_tsuno_Chikara_____-_Takahashi_Kouich/AnalysisFramework"/>
